 so far, but like I said, I've only played for a few hours.", "timestamp_created": 1720395494, "timestamp_updated": 1720395494, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "169286703", "author": {"steamid": "76561197968598641", "personaname": "urkelhaze", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/urkelhaze/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 541, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 296, "last_played": 1729660257, "avatar": "c5754d900f7166d9c3f87e310e5e80a6544ff433"}, "language": "english", "review": "its very good", "timestamp_created": 1720395092, "timestamp_updated": 1720395092, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "169284501", "author": {"steamid": "76561198303511054", "personaname": "moonloft", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198303511054/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 16999, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13885, "last_played": 1787029022, "avatar": "3a1587f93b4ecc949da295034c6c44e12f9c234f"}, "language": "english", "review": "I had a total addiction to this game, I'm cured now (I think?).\nRecommendations:\n- Don't play on the easiest difficulty setting \n- Try new characters!\n- Most items are fine, don't laser focus on \"meta\" items\n- Remember there are no item limits in a run \n- No shame in using modifiers, the can give you a handicap or make a run more challenging\n- Have fun and stress test your PC/device with the amount of stuff in your screen\n- If you reach the point where every thing dies without you inputting any movement, attacks or abilities, that's Risk of Rain at its peak XD", "timestamp_created": 1720392720, "timestamp_updated": 1720392720, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.509325027465820312", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "169283781", "author": {"steamid": "76561199229970445", "personaname": "XeddyLore", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199229970445/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 1333, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 234, "last_played": 1767222839, "avatar": "8f95ebf52ff15a7a47d41f12e2ccc1a5440fedd0"}, "language": "english", "review": "haha. funny bandit lights out go BANG BANG", "timestamp_created": 1720391974, "timestamp_updated": 1720391974, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}]}